', 'Mechanical assembly of the comparative matrix from per-candidate scores in D-0119 (A), D-0121 (B), D-0132 (C). The comparison applies D-0108 framework + D-0110 weighting + D-0113 lock; no methodological commitment is added by this comparison. Session 7''s purpose is to make the tradeoff structure visible to Session 8''s selection — not to make the selection itself.
