[Reconciliation 2026-05-15, session_2026-05-15a] review_status migrated PENDING → NA per C8 (DG-NON requires review_status=NA). The "awaiting project-owner adoption" semantic was previously expressed via review_status=PENDING because the DecisionStatus enum did not include PROVISIONAL at the time D-0138 was authored (2026-05-02). The 2026-05-15 widening of DecisionStatus (PROPOSED/PROVISIONAL) moved that semantic to the status field, where it remains as PROVISIONAL. The review_status field reverts to its protocol-intended meaning: NA for DG-NON delegations (which have no DG-REVIEW review batch). The opus/200/synth → effort_level 200 widening was applied to schemas/decision.py and governance/decision-protocol.md §3.2 + §4.2 + §4.4 in the same session.
