', 'PRIMARY = language the jurisdiction authors statutes/codes/standards in; SECONDARY = official/ administrative but non-primary (co-official, major regional, or colonial-legacy law/higher-ed language). 70 rows (50 PRIMARY / 20 SECONDARY) across all 48 jurisdictions; [PRIMARY-LANGUAGE-GAP] flags CY/ET/TH/ZA whose primary authoring language is outside the 19. COLONIAL role remains withdrawn (DR-2026-06-11). Applied via data migration data_20260724060958.
